  "remarks": "Alexander Ponomarenko is a leading businessperson operating in Russia. He is the former Chairman of the Board of Sheremetyevo International Airport. Together with Arkady Rotenberg and Alexander Skorobogatko, he owns the Moscow-Domodedovo Airport as well as the Sheremetyevo International Airport. He holds shares in TPS Real Estate.",
